# Architecture

- Keep stages explicit: extract → source model → normalize → canonical → domain rules → validate → review → WritePlan → contract check → execute → read-back → verify.
- `src/domain` must never import Playwright, AI SDKs, or filesystem I/O for side effects.
- Extraction must never write to TakeAwayHero.
- Browser adapters must not make menu-business decisions.
- Prefer boring, testable pure functions in domain.
- Stable `sourceId` identity; never use product names as IDs or ProductChoice refs.
